Package: dplaceR
Type: Package
Title: An R Interface to the D-PLACE Cross-Cultural Database
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Jason",
    family = "Hodgson",
    email = "jason.hodgson@aru.ac.uk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3849-2245"))
Description: Provides convenient access to data from D-PLACE
    (Database of Places, Language, Culture and Environment,
    <https://d-place.org>), a cross-cultural database linking ethnographic,
    linguistic, environmental, and geographic information for societies
    around the world. A snapshot of the D-PLACE CLDF ('Cross-Linguistic
    Data Format') dataset is bundled with the package, and functions are
    provided to browse and filter societies, cultural variables and their
    coded values, dataset contributions, and language phylogenies, and to
    assemble analysis-ready tables joining societies, values, and variable
    metadata. See Kirby et al. (2016) <doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0158391>
    for a description of the D-PLACE project.
